{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_chen2_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chen2_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "道路",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chen2_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f2d2c0a5adc25619daaf17d69ab37e7f567d09e198c86b0a149f44b9398a64e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "饒命啊，陳女俠，我再也不敢了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你的眼神和你放在腰後面的手可不是這麼說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "地方不錯，挺適合藏人的，準備了不少人吧？都出來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "嘿，不愧是陳女俠，弟兄們，都出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "慢著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不夠意思啊，老陳，打架怎麼能不算我一個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你這不是來了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嚯，老陳，我發現自從你去了羅德島，越來越會說話了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "別廢話了，一人一半。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "嘖，這麼多人一起上居然都不是你的對手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "又是特意演一齣讓我出手，又是埋伏，只是對付我一個，何必大費周章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "你擋了太多人的財路了，陳女俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "我真是不明白，你和林女俠現在是這座城市最熱門的人物，又有市長給你們撐腰，只要你們想，錢和地位還不是搶著找你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "為什麼不能乖乖去拍你的廣告，上你的節目，非要來幹這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "你自己有錢不去賺，還要害我們賺不到錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不關你事，乖乖跟我去警察局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "哈哈，警察局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "多索雷斯警察局的牢房冷清了這麼些年，這一次倒是開張了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "但是，陳女俠，你知不知道，只要我背後的人和那邊打一聲招呼，說不定你前腳剛走，我們就出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......但這個教訓你得給我記著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "我記著呢，陳女俠你這麼厲害，我怎麼忘得了？嘻嘻嘻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "得了，老陳，和他說這些說不通的，還不如打斷他一隻手，他就沒功夫在這嘻嘻哈哈了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不會這麼做，你也別想，雖然我現在沒有立場要求你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "得了吧，老陳，你不會以為我以前是因為你是我上司才聽你的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不過嘛，不打斷他的手，堵住他的嘴總可以吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說著，星熊用繩子繞過罪犯的嘴，用力一捆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "咕唔唔唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "隨你的便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "好了，把他們送到警察局去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這幫人涉嫌破壞公共財物，以及蓄意襲擊我，就交給你們處理了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "什麼？他們竟然敢襲擊陳小姐你？這這這，請交給我們吧，我保證讓他們吃足苦頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罪犯",
      "text": "唔咕咕咕！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "別給我使眼色了，惹了陳小姐，你背後有什麼人都一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "給他們應有的懲罰就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諂媚的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "行，您說什麼就是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嗯？那邊怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "那可是我好不容易賺來的錢啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "你怎麼能這麼說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "我就說了你能怎麼樣？你大爺我今天心情不好，不想坐牢就給我滾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "你，你......唉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "陳、陳小姐？沒、沒什麼，這傢伙在這無理取鬧呢，嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "陳女俠？！我可沒有無理取鬧！我本來存了一年的錢來參加比賽，這次比賽我稍微還賺了點，就一起存進了卡裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "然後上午的時候，我走在路上卡被人偷了，我就想找警察幫我抓小偷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "但是他問了我存款數目後，就嘲笑我這點錢也來報案，讓我滾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "是，啊，不是，我的意思是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......哪裡可以看到城內無人機的監控？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "啊？那個......局裡就有，不過，很久沒用過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "帶我去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "跟我來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "謝、謝謝你，陳女俠！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "房間裡有點悶，兩位見諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "行了，鑰匙給我，接下來交給我們就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "好的，好的，那個，有用得著我的地方請儘管叫我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嚯，這裡的設備看起來真高級，比我們局裡的都要先進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "就是這地方一看就壓根沒人用，浪費了這麼好的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "局裡的監控設備更新了嗎？我走之前提過一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "沒呢，不過許可批下來了，估計接下來要折騰好一陣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼樣，能操作嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "用的是哥倫比亞的系統，看得懂。至於認證，嘖，忘了把剛才那人留下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我試試......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陳說著將自己的手機靠近了認證終端，清脆的通行提示音響起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "行吧，看來他們確實把許可權都給我開放了，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "那不是挺好，你要不然乾脆在這裡再就業得了，這些人都聽你的，不比在龍門幹得順心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "得了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "那個，兩位，我聽不懂你們在說什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哦，我們龍門來的，聊天的時候下意識地就會用回家鄉話，別在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "好的好的，兩位慢聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你看起來放鬆了許多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "是的，陳女俠您願意幫我我就放心了，城裡的人都知道您和這些警察不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "有您幫忙，就算最後沒找到小偷，我也認了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "放心，這種案子我和老陳處理過沒有一千件，也有八百件了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你是什麼時候在哪裡被偷的？最好具體一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "大概在十一點的時候，在諾克斯步行街中間那一段......就是有一間很大的酒吧前面的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那不是林雨霞那家酒吧的附近嗎......你先在外面等著吧，我來幫你查，這裡的東西你不能看太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "放心，你提供的線索很具體，就算監控沒拍到，多半也有目擊者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "好的，那就拜託您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "說完，參賽選手走出監控室，在外面等待了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嘖嘖，不愧是老陳，走到哪裡都被人信賴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這本來是這裡的警察該做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你給他們做個榜樣也不錯不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那也得他們願意學。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈，確實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "過來幫把手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "時間段鎖定在十點到十二點區間，我來看這兩個攝影機，你看那兩個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不過，老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "幹嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "有句話我不知道當講不當講。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你說這話的時候從來沒有把話咽回去過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哈哈。你剛才對那些不成器的傢伙們說話的時候，很有一回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我以前也這樣給局裡的人訓話，習慣了，你說得對，是得改。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不是，你沒聽明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "局裡人你知道底細，你訓的都是他們確實應該去做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "而這些人，你也知道他們的底細，但你卻好像已經知道你無法改變他們，所以只讓他們去做一些表面的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "以前的陳警司，可不這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哎，你別誤會，我其實想說，這是好事，大大的好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "陰陽怪氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這可冤枉我了，哎，我看到外面那哥們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "時間段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "十點三十五分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好，我來看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......有了。鎖定這個人，找出他的行動軌跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "OK。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......和他的同夥會合了，看來他是附近幫派的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "這不是最近風頭正盛的陳女俠嗎，有何貴幹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "有空？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "很難說有，也很難說沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "幫我找個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陳和星熊以及參賽選手來到和林雨霞約定的位置。\n在那裡，林雨霞正百無聊賴地擺弄著手中的卡，而她的腳邊，則躺著昏迷過去，被捆成一團的小偷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "接著，是你的卡沒錯吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "對對對，沒錯，就是這張卡，太謝謝您了，林女俠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "欠你個人情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "免了，順手的事，而且我也沒什麼事用得到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "林雨霞，我就在店裡換了三件衣服的功夫，你人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "我看到一個老奶奶過馬路很不方便，就去扶了她一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "這裡是商場五樓！你從哪裡能看到老奶奶啊，而且樓下是步行街！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "限你五分鐘之內出現，否則你死定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "或者你可以替我去幫詩懷雅扛她的購物袋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那還是算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "那就沒事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "text": "這個人就交給你處置了，回見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "回見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嘖嘖，不管看幾次都覺得怪不可思議的，老陳你居然能和林小姐搞好關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我和她這算搞好了關係嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "當然算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "好好保管你的卡，別再丟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "一定，一定。真是不知道該怎麼感謝兩位還有林女俠才好，為了我這樣的人居然做到這份上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "作為警察，本來就該保障市民的安全和利益。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "兩位都是警察嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我以前是，她現在是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "原來如此，要是這座城市裡的警察都能像您說的那樣就好了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "即使不是警察，作為一個人，幫助另一個人也是應該的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我以前也是這麼想的，但是來到這座城市後，感覺又好像不是這樣的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你不是本地人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "不是，不如說，這裡大部分像我一樣的打工仔都不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我家原本在辛嘉斯政府管轄的一座村子裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "有一次辛嘉斯和真正玻利瓦爾省人起了衝突，結果我們整個村子都被真正玻利瓦爾省人給毀了，死了不少人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我運氣好，當時在山上打獵，逃過一劫，結果回來看到村子變成那樣就跑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "本來想當兵，但是軍隊不要我，我最後沒辦法，聽說這裡好賺錢，就跑來了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "抱歉，提起你的傷心事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "......老實說，您說提到我的傷心事，但我自己回想起過去，現在都感覺好像在做夢一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "為什麼這麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我今年三十五，在家鄉的村子生活了二十多年，來到這裡才不到十年，但我有時候會覺得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "會覺得過去的生活好像是假的一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我以前也覺得幫別人是對的事情，但是剛才聽您這麼說，我卻感覺好像很久沒聽人說過，而我自己也很久沒有產生過這樣的想法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "說實話，如果當時在警局那邊，我不是向警察求救的那個，而是像您一樣在旁邊看著的那個，我一定不會去幫那個求救的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我自己其實也知道那樣沒用，就是氣不過，本來也沒想著他們真的會幫我，沒想到遇上了您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "在這座城市裡，有錢就是能辦成很多事，沒錢就不要指望事能辦成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "想翻身就去碰運氣，去參加幫派、去賭、去搶，只想著努力工作賺錢的都是傻子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "參加大獎賽也是碰運氣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "當然是，我膽子小，不敢賭，也不敢搶，對我這種人來說，參加大獎賽就是最穩妥的賺大錢的方式了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "我們這種不指望贏的，只要能海選出線就賺了，要是第一輪還能贏，說不定還能混點名氣，賺得更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "對了，我在一家餐廳打工，我和老闆說一聲，請兩位還有林小姐在店裡吃一頓吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳，怎麼說，乾脆把Missy也叫上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "太好了，我這就回去和老闆說一聲，要是知道陳林兩位女俠要光臨他的餐廳，他也一定很高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "參賽選手",
      "text": "那我先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "怎麼了，老陳，不把人送回去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "星熊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......幫我個忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "哦？這可真是太陽打西邊出來了。事先聲明，沒錢，我還要找Missy借錢呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "行了，不逗你了。說吧，就衝著這些年來，我第一次從你嘴裡聽到這句話，無論什麼忙，我都幫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "什麼女俠，不就是仗著自己有市長撐腰，還真把自己當回事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "我要是有市長撐腰我也做得到啊，嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "啊，那個，這個，您回來了，陳小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那個，您背後的這個人就是小偷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "對，交給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "沒問題，沒問題，惹到陳小姐頭上，我一定讓他吃點苦頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "還有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "您還有什麼吩咐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我剛剛去和坎黛拉女士說了一件事，就是，呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "陳小姐的意思是，她也知道自己太顯眼，讓你們局子在坎黛拉女士面前有點沒面子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "所以她剛才特意去找了一趟坎黛拉女士，希望提高這邊局裡的績效和獎金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "坎黛拉女士看在我們陳小姐的面子上，特批了一筆資金，只要局裡的人有實績，就會有獎金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "陳小姐還會開課和帶隊，給大家傳授一些她過去作為警察時抓捕罪犯的方法與技巧，讓大家能更好地贏取坎黛拉女士為大家準備的獎金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "......我可以問一下，獎金有多少嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "一樁案子，這個數。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊用手指在對方面前比劃了一個數字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "......陳、陳小姐，您真是個了不起的人！我這就去告訴其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "還有，這個人就算在你頭上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐煩的多索雷斯警察",
      "text": "謝謝、謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "是不是感覺很難受？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "不能說很好受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是，既然你問我，“怎麼樣才能讓這裡的警察至少能夠動起來”，那麼這就是我能給出的最簡單直接的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但這樣......還是不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "沒錯，這樣不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我可以給你很多理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "首先，你初來乍到，即使你有超強的人格魅力，也很難馬上服眾，你可以回想一下你當年剛進局裡的時候花了多久讓那幫刺頭都服你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這種時候，用利益讓人來服從你是最簡單的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......我沒記錯的話，我是把他們一個個打服的，你是最後一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我可沒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "其次，當你明明擁有某種東西卻不去使用時，所謂依靠自己的力量往往只是一種傲慢的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "尤其是當那些東西是財產，權力，地位這些的時候，你還不如就那麼去使用它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我過去也給人這樣的感覺嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你用自己多年的努力讓龍門沒有人這麼認為了，但這裡不是龍門，而你也不會在這裡停留那麼久，你怎麼證明自己？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "再者，剛才他發的牢騷你我聽得一清二楚，這裡的警察變成這樣你真的覺得是因為他們不想履行自己的義務嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他們就天生混帳？他們覺得和幫派企業勾結天經地義？他們一通電話就要放人心裡會覺得開心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這裡還叫警察局呢，他們知道自己是警察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "他們不是不想，是不能，是不敢，他們可能有過勇氣，但也被現實磨平了，任何大道理對他們來說都毫無意義，還不如用最直接的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這些都是理由，而你也確實應該說，你這樣不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但你做了，這是事實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你知道，但你還不夠清楚，老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "如果是過去，我害怕你會死在毫無意義的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "而現在，你離開龍門後確實變了一些，而且，至少從我的角度看來，是好的變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "但是，我反過來又有些害怕你會迷失自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "會嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......誰知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "我說的有點太多了，不管我怎麼害怕，這都是你自己的決定，我不會干涉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你確定不會再攔在我的面前？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唷，還記仇呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不過這可確實不好說，你知道，我這個人，可沒有那麼把誓言當回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "呵，星熊不把誓言當回事，這個笑話倒是很新奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我還不知道怎麼回答你，星熊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "就好像我依然不知道該如何以我來評判剛才的事，評判這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我恐怕只能先走下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "這就夠了，老陳，這就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "雖然我說的挺嚇人，但你還是不要忘了，你身邊有很多人，你不懂的話，是可以向他們請教的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那接下來的開課，你來主講吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你是現役警察，我又不是，而且你不是說，我應該多向身邊的人請教？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這一次，我當學生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "......嘖，你都這麼說了，那我還能拒絕不成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "不行，我要叫上Missy，不能只有我一個人受這個罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "隨你，你叫上林雨霞都行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "唉，好好的度假就這麼沒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......星熊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "說實在的，這座城市的太陽太刺眼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "是挺刺眼的，我也覺得。但那至少是太陽啊，老陳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "或許吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
